/P 104 0 R
/E (On the question of refund of GST already paid on such centage charges, the AAR held that refund is governed strictly by Section 54 of the CGST Act, which prescribes a limitation period of two years from the relevant date. The Authority clarified that it has no jurisdiction to relax or override the statutory limitation period and declined to issue any ruling extending the time limit or adjudicating factual eligibility of refund beyond what Section 54 permits.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
