/E (The reliance on the Gujarat High Court judgment in Gujarat Chamber of Commerce and Industry v. Union of India \(2025 \(1\) TMI 516 \) is significant. Even where long-term lease of industrial plots is treated as supply of service, Entry 41 of Notification No. 12/2017-CT \(Rate\) prescribes Nil rate for one-time upfront premium for leases of 30 years or more granted by State Industrial Development Corporations. Thus, even assuming arguendo that such grant is a supply, it stands exempt. )
